2 CONC confuse her with her sister [http://www.geni.com/people/Eparchia/6000000026383362338 (Eparchia)], supposed wife of [http://www.geni.com/people/Petronius-Maximus-Roman-Emperor/6000000002187572907 Emperor Petronius Maximus].
