1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baderic ~~ See Wikipedia for more information.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Baderic, Baderich, Balderich, Balderick or Boderic (c.480-c.529), son of Bisinus and Basina, was a co-king of the Thuringii. He and his brothers Hermanfrid and Berthar succeeded their father Bisinus. After Hermanfrid defeated Bert
2 CONC har in battle, he invited King Theuderic I of Metz to help him defeat Baderic in return for half of the kingdom. Theuderic I agreed and Baderic was defeated and killed in 529. Hermanfrid became the sole king.
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.genealogiequebec.info/testphp/prodmode.php?no=37810 Other info]
2 CONT
