2 CONT
2 CONT                 + B: Abt. 445
2 CONT
2 CONT The Lame's father was Childebert I Cologne and his mother was Clovis the Riparian Cologne.  He was an only child.  He died, at the age of 64 years, in year 0509 due to murder / assassination (Murdered by Cloderic at instigation of
2 CONC  Clovis I King of Franks).1 
2 CONT
2 CONT           o General Notes
2 CONT
