2 CONT He was the son of Pupienus, later Emperor, and wife Sextia Cethegilla.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Consul Ordinarius in 236 joint with Emperor Maximinus I (Thrax).
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Cornelia Marullina, born c. 205, daughter of Lucius Cornelius Cossonius Scipio Salvidius Orfitus and wife, and had two children: Pupiena Sextia Paulina Cethegilla, born c. 225 and named after her paternal aunt, who marr
2 CONC ied Marcus Maecius Probus, and Publius Pupienus Maximus.
2 CONT
