2 CONT
2 CONT Menia went, probably after Bisin's death, together with her daughter to Wacho's Lombard kingdom on the central Danubeand married there around 510 in '''her second marriage to a [Lombard] from Gausus' family'''. From this marriage 
2 CONC came Audoin 
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Menia
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of her husband Bizin, she went with her daughter Radegunda to the Lombard Kingdom of Wacho on the middle Danube, and '''around 510 she married for the second time a [Lombard] an unknown name of the Gaussian family'
2 CONC '' (Gauss). From this marriage she has a son: Audoin († ca. 560),
