1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''' AUDOVERE''' (-murdered 580)
2 CONT x  ([549]) CHILPERICH (< 535-murdered Chelles [27 Sep/9 Oct] 584)
2 CONT *THEODEBERT [Thibert] ([548/51]-killed 573, bur Angoulême)
2 CONT *MEROVECH (-murdered Thérouanne 577, bur 584 Paris, Saint-Germain-des-Prés)
2 CONT *CHLODOVECH [Clovis] (-murdered Noisy-le-Grand end 580, bur Noisy-le-Grand, transferred 584 to Paris, Saint-Germain-des-Prés)
