2 CONT *CHILDESWINDIS [Childesinde] ([567]-)
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEROVINGIANS.htm#ChilpericIdied584B
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Audovera was the first wife or mistress of Chilperic I, king of Neustria.
2 CONT They had four children.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Theudebert, died in the war of 575
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Merovech (d.578), married the widow Brunhilda and became his father's enemy
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Clovis, assassinated by Fredegund in 580
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Basina, nun, led a revolt in the abbey of Poitiers
2 CONT
2 CONT She was later sent to a convent by Chilperic. Chilperic and his third wife, Fredegunde, later had her murdered.
