2 CONT
2 CONT    3. ^ Catholic Encyclopedia, "John of Antioch"
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. ^ Noel Emmanuel Lenski, Failure of Empire: Valens and the Roman State in the Fourth Century A.D. (2003), page 103]
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. ^ a b c Walter E. Roberts , "Valentinian II (375-92 A.D.)"
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. ^ a b c Prosopography of the Later Roman Empire, Vol. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT    7. ^ The Gallic Rooster
2 CONT
2 CONT    8. ^ Walter E. Roberts, "Magnus Maximus (383-388 A.D.)"
2 CONT
