2 CONT
2 CONT    2. his conquest of Gaul, and
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. his conversion to the Roman Catholic Faith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clovis (c. 466-511) was the first King of the Franks to unite all the Frankish tribes under one king. He also introduced Christianity. He was the son of Childeric I and Basina. At age 16, he succeeded his father, in the year 481[1
