2 CONT Dagobert I's father was King of all Franks Clothaire Meroving II and his mother was Haldetrude de Bourgogne.  His paternal grandparents were Chilperic I Soissons  Franks and Fredegunde Franks; his maternal grandparents were Richem
2 CONC eres von Franconia and Garritrude de Hamage. He had a brother and two sisters, named Charibert II, Bertha and Emma.  He was the second oldest of the four children. He had a half-sister named Oda.  
