2 CONT
2 CONT >>>5.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Chlothar-I-the-Old-King-of-the-Franks/5585928797380086234?through=6000000005913350166 CHLOTHACHAR] [Clotaire/Lothar] ([501/02]-Soissons [30 Nov/31 Dec] 561, bur Soissons, basilique Saint-
2 CONC Médard).  
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>6.         THEODECHILDIS ([492/501]-576)?
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>7.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Clotilde-Queen-consort-of-the-Visigoths/4068314641700010384?through=6000000005913350166 CHROTHIELDIS] ['''Clotilde'''] ([502/11]-531, bur Paris, basilique des Saints-Apôtres [later église
2 CONC  de Sainte-Geneviève]).  
2 CONT
