2 CONT
2 CONT Claudia Crispina OF ROMA was born 221. She married Eutropius DE ROMA, son of Gordiana II DE ROMA. He was born 218/220 in Rome,Latium,Italy.  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Child of Claudia Crispina OF ROMA and Eutropius DE ROMA is:
2 CONT
2 CONT Constantius I Chlorus DE ROMA was born 31 Mar 242 in Rome,Latium,Italy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=:2439373&id=I519491059
