2 CONT * a)         '''ANSILA''' .  Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[33]. 
2 CONT * b)         '''EDIULF''' .  Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[34]. 
2 CONT * c)         '''VULTWULF''' .  Iordanes names "Ansila et Ediulf, Vultuulf et Hermenerig" as the sons of Achiulf[35].  
