2 CONT x SIGEBERT III King of the Franks in Austrasia ([9 Oct 630/19 Jan 631]-1 Feb 656, bur Metz, basilique de Saint-Martin).  
2 CONT *DAGOBERT II King of the Franks in Austrasia.([652/56]-murdered Woëvre forest 23 Dec 679, bur Stenay, basilique Saint-Rémi)
