2 CONT As a result of Saint Balthild's generous donations, several abbeys were founded.  She worked to abolish Christian slaves and children sold into slavery.  After her husband had died and her children were grown and established, she 
2 CONC entered an abbey and dedicated the rest of her life helping the poor and infirm. Her feast day is celebrated on January 30.
