2 CONT     : Duke of East Franks, 404. King of West Franks, 419. King of Westphalia, 430. Died 430. K: Pharamond. Elected King of the West Franks. Established the Salique Law. First King of the Franks. Also King of the Salistian Franks. 
2 CONC Died 427-430.
2 CONT
