2 CONC ntary (Grand Rapids, MI: Wm. B. Eerdmans Publishing Co., 1998), 399-400. See his discussion of Ramsay’s discoveries in former Asia Minor (modern Turkey), in the region of Pisidian Antioch. 7 http://www.pleaseconvinceme.com/index/T
