2 CONC  the Death of Marcus Aurelius (1893) Bossart-Mueller, Zur Geschichte des Kaisers A. (1868) Bryant, The Reign of Antonine (Cambridge Historical Essays, 1895) Hüttl, W. Antoninus Pius vol. I & II, Prag 1933 & 1936. Lacour-Gayet, A. 
2 CONC le Pieux et son Temps (1888) Watson, P. B. Marcus Aurelius Antoninus (London, 1884), chap. ii.
