2 CONC aged to [her]" after being pressured to desert Deoteria but that Wisigardis "soon died"[78].  m thirdly ([542/47]) -.  Gregory of Tours records that Theodebert "married another woman" after his second wife died but gives no detail
2 CONC s[79].  [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEROVINGIANS.htm#ClovisIB MEDLANDS] 
