1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Doda''' (nickname for Chrothildis)  was first thought of as the daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Wandregisis/6000000010918502385?through=6000000000957281690 ‘'''Wandregis'''’] and [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC people/Farahild/6000000000700960321?through=6000000000957281690 '''Farahild'''].  Allegedly connected to over 25  pairs of parents.   Modern insights, (C. Settipani) conclude that she was a daughter of Ansegisel of Metz and his wi
2 CONC fe Begga. -discussion is not closed.
2 CONT * Not the same as [https://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Dode-of-Metz/6000000006296799111 '''Saint Dode of Metz''']
2 CONT *Not the same as [https://www.geni.com/people/Amelberga-Of-Maubeuge/6000000179077764895 '''Amalberga of Maubeuge''']
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Clotilda''' ('''Chrothildis'''). Her parentage is unknown. Settipani speculates [https://www.geni.com/people/Ansigisel-of-Metz-Mayor-of-the-Palace-of-Austrasia/5535400391550125499 '''Dux Ansegisel'''] had a daughter Doda who ma
2 CONC rried Théodéric III, and was the mother of [https://www.geni.com/people/Bertrade-de-Prüm/6000000001842551452 '''Bertrade of Prüm'''], (Gen-Medieval-L, Nov. 16, 1999).
2 CONT
2 CONT aka..Regent Clothilde / Chrothildis
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: ABT 0640 in Heristal, Belgium
2 CONT Death: after 3 Jun 0692
2 CONT Father: Ansegisel Mayor of Palace Austrasia b: ABT 0602 in Metz, France (perhaps) 
2 CONT Mother: St. Beggue of Landen b: ABT 0613 in Landen, Belgium (perhaps)
2 CONT Marriage: Theuderic I King of Franks b: ABT 0636 in Metz, France
2 CONT 692 Regent Queen Dowager Clothilde of Neustria and Bourgogne (France)
2 CONT
2 CONT Regent for a few months for son Childéric. She is also known as Rothilde, Chrothéchildis or Doda (d. 694/9).
2 CONT
