2 CONT I5207 Name: Argotta Of Sciambr Queen Of Franks 1 2 Sex: F ALIA: Argatta Princess of the Salic Franks Title: Queen Of Franks Birth: ABT 376 in Thuringia, Germany 1 2 Occupation: Queen Of Franks Death: 438 Name: Argatta 3 Name: Argo
2 CONC tta Princess of the Salic Franks Birth: 376 Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     [RCKarnes.ged]
2 CONT
2 CONT     from Thuringia
2 CONT
2 CONT     Argatta, the mother of all the Kings of France, married Pharomond, Duke of the East Franks and elected King of the West Franks and reckoned by historians as the first King of France. (See descent from Kings of France.) Then fo
2 CONC llowed Clodio; Sigmerius; Ferreolus; Ausbert; Arncaldus; St Arnolph; Anchises was Duke of Brabant, having married Begga, heiress of Brabant, daughter of Pipin De Landis, the first Duke of Brabant.
2 CONT     (Kin of Mellcene Thurman Smith, page 366)
2 CONT
2 CONT     Argotta was a daughter of Genobaud, Lord of the Franks (d. 419). She married Pharamond (Faramund). Their children were: Clodion of Tournai (Clodio or Clodius Crintus) Lord of the West Franks (430-446), Fredemundus, and Frotmun
2 CONC d.
2 CONT     (Wikipedia)
2 CONT
2 CONT     ...x
2 CONT     1 NAME Argotta (Argote) /de Cambray/ 2 SOUR S033320 3 DATA 4 TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001 1 BIRT 2 DATE ABT. 406 2 SOUR S033320 3 DATA 4 TEXT Date of Import: Jan 17, 2001
2 CONT
2 CONT     [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT     Sources: Kraentzler 1772, 1777; Collins; AF; Pfafman.
2 CONT     Collins/Pfafman: Argotta, Mother of all kings of France.
2 CONT     K: Argote/Argotta de Cimbres (Cambray).
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Genebald II King Of The East Franks b: ABT 354 in Fécamp, Seine-Maritime, Upper Normandy, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Pharamond Of The Franks King Of France b: ABT 370 in Westphalia, Germany
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children Fredemundus Of The Franks
2 CONT     Has No Children Frotmund Of The Franks
2 CONT     Has Children Clodion of France King of the Franks b: ABT 395 in Westphalia, Germany
2 CONT
