1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Aelius_Lamia_Plautius_Aelianus Lucius Aelius Lamia Plautius Aelianus (c. 45 - 81/96)] was a Consul Suffectus in 80.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lamia was probably a son of Tiberius Plautius Silvanus Aelianus He married Domitia Longina, the daughter of Gnaeus Domitius Corbulo and Cassia Longina. Their son was probably Lucius Fundanius Laemia Aelianus.
