2 CONT Marcus Annius Verus Caesar (after May 162-10 September 169) was one of the thirteen children born to Faustina, the wife of the Roman emperor Marcus Aurelius. In 166, he was made his father's first heir. On 10 September 169, he die
2 CONC d of natural causes in Rome. His brother Commodus thus became his father’s new heir and later successor.
