2 CONT Lucius Vipstanus Claudius Poplicola Messalla (c. 105 – aft. 140) was a sal. col. and a quadrumvir quinquennalis in 140.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Lucius Vipstanus Messalla and wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married his fifth cousin Helvidia Priscilla, born c. 115, daughter of Publius Helvidius Priscus and wife Plautia Quinctilia and had a son Lucius Valerius Messalla Thrasea Poplicola Helvidius Priscus.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source :''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Vipstanus_Claudius_Poplicola_Messalla
