2 CONT
2 CONT He served as a praetor and, through this position, became a senator. In 70/71, Patruinus possibly served as governor of Germania Superior. Upon his death, in 78, in Rome, Patruinus was a priest and served as a member of the Arval 
2 CONC Brethren. After that, Marciana and Matidia went to live with Trajan and his wife Pompeia Plotina.
2 CONT
