2 CONT
2 CONT Lucius Vipstanus Messalla (c. 75 - aft. 115) was a Roman politician who was Roman consul in AD 115.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Vipstanus Messalla was the son of Lucius Vipstanus Messalla. He was elected consul ordinarius in AD 115 alongside Marcus Pedo Vergilianus. He had a son named Lucius Vipstanus Claudius Poplicola Messalla.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Vipstanus_Messalla_(consul)
