1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adelperga
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Adelperga''' (born c. 740 – died after 787) was a Lombard noblewoman, Duchess of Benevento by marriage to Arechis II of Benevento. She acted as regent of Benevento for her son Grimoald in 787-788. She was the third of four daug
2 CONC hters of Desiderius, King of the Lombards, and his wife Ansa. Her elder sister Desiderata was a wife of [https://www.geni.com/people/Charlemagne/6000000002457013227 Charlemagne].
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT == MedLands ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''ADALPERGA''' (-after Feb 788).  The Chronicon Salernitanum names Adalperga, daughter of Desiderius, as wife of "Arichis Beneventanus dux"[595].  She is referred to as the wife of Duke Arichis in the Versus de Annis by Paulus Di
2 CONC aconus, the initial letters of each verse of the poem reading "Adelperga pia"[596].  Paul the Deacon dedicated his history of the Roman Empire to her[597].  Pope Hadrian I records "Adalberga relicta Arigihs…duas filias suas secum"
2 CONC  in a letter to Charles I King of the Franks dated to [777/78][598].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ( [758] ) ARICHIS II Duke of Benevento, son of --- ([736]-Salerno 26 Aug 787, bur Salerno Cathedral). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ITALY,%20Kings%20to%20962.htm#AdalbergaMArichisIIBenevento
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Desiderius Wikipedia] retrieved 16 April 2023
2 CONT
2 CONT Desiderius married Ansa (or Ansia) and, as well as a son, had four daughters:
2 CONT # Anselperga (or Anselberga), abbess of San Salvatore monastery of Brescia
2 CONT # Adelperga (or Adelberga), married Arechis II of Benevento
2 CONT # Liutperga (also Liutpirc or Liutberga), married Tassilo III of Bavaria
2 CONT # Desiderata married Charlemagne in 770 and was repudiated (a medieval form of divorce) in 771.
2 CONT # Adelchis (or Adalgis), patrician in Constantinople
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Gerberga-di-Lombardia/6000000001412918489 is not proved  as a daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT
