2 CONT '''Herod Pollio of Chalcis''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Herod's father was Aristobulus of Judea IV and his mother was Bernice of Judea.  His paternal grandparents were King Herod (The Great) Judea and Mariamne of Judea I; his maternal grandparents were  Castobanes of Judea and  Salome 
2 CONC of Judea.  He was the second of three children.  He had a brother and a sister, named Agrippa and Mariamne.  He died in year 0048.1  
2 CONT
2 CONT Herod's family with Berenice of Judea
2 CONT They had a daughter named Julia. Please see [http://www.geni.com/discussions/107282?msg=784934   Discussion] for questions about whether his daughter or his wife was Julia of Chalcis 
