2 CONT Saint
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT His ancestry is continued elsewhere on this tree.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigimaerus I's father was Clodion (Clodius Long Haired) Franks and his mother was Basina Thuringia.  His paternal grandparents were Pharamond Franks and Argotta Franks; his maternal grandparents were King Alaric of the Visigoths I
2 CONC  and Galla Placida Rome. He had two brothers named Maerovaee and Maerovaeus.  He was the youngest of the three children.
