2 CONT Berenice was the daughter of Salome I, the sister of Herod the Great. She married her cousin Aristobulus who was executed by his father in 6 BC; she was accused of complicity in his murder. By Aristobulus she was the mother of Her
2 CONC od Agrippa I, Herod of Chalcis, Herodias, Mariamne III and Aristobulus Minor.
