2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: 51 A.D.
2 CONT
2 CONT FATHER: Drusus Nero TIBERIUS I CLAUDIUS
2 CONT
2 CONT MOTHER: Antonia AUGUSTA
2 CONT
2 CONT FIRST MARRIAGE: Agrippina II verch GERMANICUS in Lugundum, Gaul - now Lyons, Rhone-Alpes,
2 CONT
2 CONT France
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Julia Gerunda verch TIBERIUS DRUSUS NERO - Abt 10 A.D. in Lugundum, Gaul - now Lyons,
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhone-Alpes, France
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Tiberius Claudius III TIBERIUS DRUSUS NERO - Abt 12 A.D. in Lugundum, Gaul - now Lyons,
2 CONT
