1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Tigridia of Ireland Queen-Consort of Cornouaille in Brittany'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Tigridia verch Calpurnius was born c.330.1 She married Gradlon Mawr ap Cynan Meriadoc the King of Cornouaille (an independent region within Brittany) the son of Erbin ap Cynan Meriadoc King of Brittany, before 355.1
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the sister of Saint Patrick of Ireland and Saint Dareca Queen-Consort of Dumnonia, and the grandniece of Saint Martin Archbishop of Tours.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with King Gradlon: 
2 CONT Salomon I ap Gradlon the High King of Brittany (c.355 - 4461)
2 CONT Guitol ap Gradlon of Brittany Prince of Dumnonia (c.3591 - )
