2 CONC r. Berenike is the only child she has with Costobarus, according to Wagner. Other sources attribute Joseph as a son of Salome & Herod's brother, also called Joseph. Please see [http://www.geni.com/discussions/108048?msg=788003 Dis
2 CONC cussion] 
