2 CONC for this chapter was probably his speech in the senate. Jump up ^ Tac. Ann.16.25-6 Jump up ^ Tac.Ann.16.27-9, 33 Jump up ^ Tac.Ann.34-5; Dio 62.26.4 Categories: Senators of the Roman EmpirePhilosophers of Roman ItalyRoman-era Stoi
