2 CONT
2 CONT He was born around 280; he had a son, Lucius Aurelius Avianius Symmachus, whose son was the famous orator Quintus Aurelius Symmachus. He was a Neoplatonist philosopher and a Pagan; it is possible that his parents were Aurelius Her
2 CONC mogenes, great priest of Asia, and Tullia Valeria, great priestess.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 319 was proconsul of Achaea, in 330 became Consul.
