1 OCCU prinsesse, Princess of Cornwall, Virgin Saint
1 TITL Saint
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} St. Ursula Princess of Britain (Dumnonia)	
2 CONT
2 CONT Born :	Abt. 305
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Dynod King of Britain (Dumnonia)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage	- Cynan King of Britain (Dumnonia)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	Abt. 325 - Cadfan King of Britain (Dumnonia)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:	
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.american-pictures.com/genealogy/persons/per08810.htm#0	
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Dynod gave his daughter, St.Ursula, in marriage to Conan Meriadoc, but she would only consent if she was first able to go on a pilgrimage with eleven thousand virginal followers. They were all massacred in Cologne.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT St. Ursula Princess of Britain (Dumnonia)	
2 CONT
2 CONT Born :	Abt. 305
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Dynod King of Britain (Dumnonia)
2 CONT
