2 CONC urincbertus et filius meus Rotbertus" donated property "in pago Rinensi in villa…Birstat" to Lorsch by charter dated Jun 770[533].  m ---.  The name of Thuringbert's wife is not known.  Thuringbert & his wife had one child:
