1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agrippina_the_Elder
2 CONT
2 CONT 4217576384055059. Augusta Agrippina "The Younger" ROMAN EMPIRE,1601,1746 daughter of Ceasar Germanicus ROMAN EMPIRE and Agrippina "The Elder" ROMAN EMPIRE, was born in 15 and died in 59 at age 44. The cause of her death was Poison
2 CONC ed. 
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Agrippina was granted the title of Augusta, a rank no wife of an emperor had held before. And she was determined to see her twelve year old son Nero take the place of Britannicus as imperial heir.
2 CONT
2 CONT She successfully arranged for Nero to be betrothed to Claudius' daughter Octavia. And a year later Claudius adopted him as son. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Then on the night of the 12 to 13 October AD 54 Claudius suddenly died. His death is generally attributed to his scheming wife Agrippina who didn't care to wait for her son Nero inherit the throne and so poisoned Claudius with mus
2 CONC hrooms.
2 CONT
2 CONT Agrippina married Emperor Rome Tiberius Claudius Drusus Nero Germanicus ROMAN EMPIRE 1601,3472 in <, , Lyons, France>. Tiberius was born 1 August 10 B.C. in Palace Augustus, Roma, Italy 3472 and died on 13 October 54 in , , Roma, 
2 CONC Italy 3472. The cause of his death was Poisoned with a treated mushroom by his wife, Agrippina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Agrippina next married Cnaeus Domitius Ahenobarbus ROMAN EMPIRE.3472 
2 CONT
2 CONT The child from this marriage was: 
2 CONT
2 CONT                       i.  Nero Claudius Drusus Germanicus ROMAN EMPIRE was born on 15 December 37 in Antium 3472 and died on 9 June 68 in Rome, , Lazio, Italy 3472 at age 30. Another name for Nero was Lucius Domitius Ahenobarbus R
2 CONC OMAN EMPIRE. 
2 CONT
