1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Marcian, Eastern Roman Emperor==
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marcian En], [https://hr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marcijan Hr]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''See also''': [https://hr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rimski_upravitelji_Dalmacije#Marcijan Marcijan, Rimski upravitelji Dalmacije]
2 CONT "Marcijan je bio porijeklom iz Dalmacije i njom je vladao praktički samostalno u periodu 454-468. Bio je prijatelj vojskovođe Aetija koji je ubijen 454. te je Marcijan iskazao poštovanje i poslušnost caru. 468. dobio je poziv da m
2 CONC ora braniti Sisciliju, ali je tamo mučki i izdajnički ubijen."
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Translation''': Marcian was originally from Dalmatia and ruled it practically independently in the period 454-468. He was a friend of the military leader Aetius, who was killed in 454, and Marcian showed respect and obedience t
2 CONC o the emperor. In 468 he was summoned to defend Siscilia, but was brutally and treacherously killed there.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Notes''': 
2 CONT * Not known, not sure and not confirmed did he was a Illyrian or Thracian (?).
2 CONT * Not known, not sure and not confirmed did he was a same person [https://www.geni.com/people/Marcelin/6000000179063309832 Marcelin], who was a proconsul and governor of Dalmatia (?).
