2 CONC ephew '''Hoamer''' and '''Euageis''' executed by his brother Ammatas in Carthage in September after the imperial general Belisar had landed 5]”
2 CONT ** John Robert Martindale: The Prosopography of the Later Roman Empire. Volume 2, Cambridge University Press, Cambridge 1980, p. 564f. (Online preview). < [https://books.google.de/books?id=G5W6vCO_pYUC&pg=PA564#v=onepage&q&f=false
2 CONC  GoogleBooks] >
