2 CONT
2 CONT ROBERT [II] (-12 Jul 807).  "Turincbertus et filius meus Rotbertus" donated property "in pago Rinensi in villa…Birstat" to Lorsch by charter dated Jun 770[601].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf im Wormsgau und Oberrheingau 795/807.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Herr zu Dienheim 795.  
2 CONT
2 CONT [same person as…?  RADBERT (-807).  Einhard records that "Radbertus missus imperatoris" died in 807 after returning from the Orient[602].  It is possible that "Radbertus" refers to "Rodbertus".]  
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly THEODERATA, daughter of --- (-before 789).  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly ISENGARDE, daughter of ---.  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.  789.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert [II] & his first wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i) ROBERT [III] (-before 19 Feb 834).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified. 
