1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Peter Bartrum, https://cadair.aber.ac.uk/dspace/bitstream/handle/2160/6516/TABLES%20-%20EARLY%20SERIES_26.png?sequence=20&isAllowed=y (May 13 2018; Anne Brannen, curator)
