0 @N6000000000437172941@ NOTE Name Suffix:<NSFX> I
1 CONT !NAME: "Bodegisel (Baudgise) I, Brother of St. Gondulfus,Bishop of Tongres,"
1 CONT !MARRIAGE: ". . . m. Palatina, dau. of Gallus Magnus, Bishop of Troyes, ca. 562,"
1 CONT !REFERENCE-QUOTED: Langston & Buck et al, - PEDIGREES OF SOME OF EMPEROR CHARLEMAGNE'S DESCENDANTS; Genealogical Publishing Company, Inc., Baltimore, Md, 1988, p.cv, Vol. II;  Sutro Library, San Francisco, CA.
