1 CONT Paulus
1 CONT Imp. Caesar Flavius Iulius Constantius Augustus V Succeeded by
1 CONT Imp. Caesar Flavius Magnus Magnentius Augustus II,
1 CONT Magnus Decentius Caesar II,
1 CONT Imp. Caesar Flavius Iulius Constantius Augustus VI,
1 CONT Flavius Claudius Constantius Caesar II
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Magnus Decentius Caesar,
1 CONT Paulus, Imp. Caesar Flavius Iulius Constantius Augustus V, Flavius Claudius Constantius Caesar Consul of the Roman Empire
1 CONT 353
1 CONT with Imp. Caesar Flavius Magnus Magnentius Augustus II
1 CONT Magnus Decentius Caesar II
1 CONT Imp. Caesar Flavius Iulius Constantius Augustus VI Succeeded by
1 CONT Imp. Caesar Flavius Iulius Constantius Augustus VII,
1 CONT Flavius Claudius Constantius Caesar III
