1 CONC and their daughter were buried--was later named after St.Genevieve, who also was buried there. K: Saint Clothilde de Bourgogne. K-1657: Chrotechilde von Altburgund (Old Bourgogne). Pfafman: Clothilda (Clothild) of Burgundy. Second
