1 CONT Amalasuntha ruled the Ostrogothic kingdom in the place of her infant son at the death of her father, King Theodoric the Great. After marrying a slave named Traguilla, her mother convinced her to divorce him and marry a noble, Euth
1 CONC aric. Their son ruled as king. Amalasuntha was killed for many tyranical deeds she commited by Theudat, King of Tuscany.
