1 CONC e, raided the Roman province of Germania, and threatened Cologne, in the latter years of Western Roman Emperor Magnus Maximus (c. 388). They reportedly also led the Chatti and the Ampsivarii. Marcomer may have been a predecessor o
1 CONC f the legendary duke Pharamond, an ancestor of the Frankish royal dynasty of the Merovingians.
