0 @N6000000002322297383@ NOTE He greatly expanded the area under Frankish hemony. He was a proven soldier
1 CONT before he came to the throne and claimed control of the peoples from the
1 CONT Baltic to beyond the Danube. By minting coins bearing his, rather than the
1 CONT Byzantine emperor's, effigy and name, Theodebert asserted his independence of
