1 CONT in 676 and finally (679) also became King of Austrasia. A puppet pure and
1 CONT simple, he then had to watch his subjects fight one another until the final
1 CONT victory of Pepin II, and the Austrasians at the Battle of Tertry in 687. See
1 CONT message under Theodoric's wife.
