0 @N6000000002322297424@ NOTE Nothing definite is known about the life of Merovech and his wife. Her
1 CONT husband was the king of the Salian Franks. He's mentioned in Gregory of
1 CONT Tour's History of the Franks and, according to later sources, fought against
1 CONT Attila the Hun at the Battle of Catalaunian Plains in 451 AD. He succeeded
1 CONT Chlodio as king in c.447. What specific relationship they were to each other
1 CONT has not yet been found, however, in this family tree system we'll acknowledge
1 CONT them as being father and son.
