0 @N6000000002187705135@ NOTE Argotta
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Argotta was a daughter of Genobaud, Lord of the Franks (d. 419). She married Pharamond (Faramund). Their children were: Clodion of Tournai (Clodio or Clodius Crintus) Lord of the West Franks (430-446), Fredemundus, and Frotmund.
