0 @N6000000000437110044@ NOTE Name Prefix:<NPFX> King Name Suffix:<NSFX> Of Brittany King Rivod 's uncle, Erich, may have held the Breton throne for a short time in his twilight years. It has been suggested that he was the original Eric in the tale of "Eric an
1 CONC d Enid" that the Welsh later transformed into a story concerning King Gerren  (aliasGereint) of Dumnonia as "Gereint and Enid". King Erich died in 478 and was succeeded by his son, Budic II .
