1 CONT Octavia Thurina Major or Octavia Major was a daughter of the Roman governor and senator Gaius Octavius from his first wife, Ancharia. Little is known of her, apart from the fact that she was living in 40 BC. Plutarch states that s
1 CONC he was a beautiful and admirable woman.
